\n<p class=\"dek\">美国精英大学不是慈善教育机构，而是靠冻结招生规模、运营校友捐赠和承接联邦研究拨款来维持品牌的卡特尔；它们卖的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大学财政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐赠基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"噬菌体靠10,000倍回复突变下注，EBV人源化抗体首现 噬菌体通过 SSR 的 10,000 倍回复突变实现赌注对冲，EBV 人源化抗体在体内阻止肿瘤，疫苗多路线推进。 This Week in Virology This Week in Virology TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies 噬菌体 赌注 hedging EBV 抗体 疫苗 认知懒惰 SSR bet-hedging contingency locus hybridoma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体用随机突变下注-ebv人类抗体首次成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:52:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌体靠10,000倍回复突变下注，EBV人源化抗体首现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">噬菌体通过 SSR 的 10,000 倍回复突变实现赌注对冲，EBV 人源化抗体在体内阻止肿瘤，疫苗多路线推进。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">赌注 hedging</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异，赌细菌防御会升级 打滑不是复制故障，而是噬菌体的一种对冲：群体里常有少数个体因重复序列改变读码框，生成还没被选中的变异。平时多数适应当下环境，细菌防御一升级，低频备选立刻接管。 This Week in Virology This Week in Virology TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies 噬菌体 赌注对冲 EBV 单克隆抗体 疫苗设计 科学传播 simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异-赌细菌防御会升级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span><