/span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三纪元是持久协作者，产品周期只有三个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 产品负责人 Tara Seshan 断言，AI 产品正从聊天、代理走向持久协作者，构建必须按两到三个月的模型能力设计；未来工作是掌舵而非划桨，写作即思考永不上自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品周期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久协作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI 盈利是泡沫：成本后置，利润前置 AI 基建的利润当下兑现，成本却摊销到未来，这构成盈利泡沫。股市会先于盈利见顶，投资者应警惕而非追逐。 Excess Returns Excess Returns The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble AI泡沫 盈利质量 杠杆ETF 黄金 贸易政策 Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本后置-利润前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>AI 盈利是泡沫：成本后置，利润前置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 基建的利润当下兑现，成本却摊销到未来，这构成盈利泡沫。股市会先于盈利见顶，投资者应警惕而非追逐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">盈利质量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"1858年纽约毒奶：证据确凿，官方却判定无害 1858年纽约牛奶掺假被指喂养婴儿致死，记者曝光后官方听证会判定无害；事件最终推动1862年州法与1906年联邦《纯净食品与药品法》。 Stuff You Missed in History Class Stuff You Missed in History Class SYMHC Classics: Swill Milk 食品掺假 公共卫生 媒体调查 美国史 牛奶安全 制度腐败 swill milk artificial feeding temperance movement spent grain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-stuffmissed-1858年纽约毒奶-证据确凿-官方委员会判定无害/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1858年纽约毒奶：证据确凿，官方却判定无害</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1858年纽约牛奶掺假被指喂养婴儿致死，记者曝光后官方听证会判定无害；事件最终推动1862年州法与1906年联邦《纯净食品与药品法》。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品掺假</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻：洗不掉、养不活、验不出死活 让美国上万人腹泻的卵囊对漂白剂和冲洗都有抵抗力，排出一到两周后才具感染性；实验室又养不活也验不出死活，疫情因此难以切断。 This Week in Virology This Week in Virology TWiV 1352: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin 寄生虫 环孢子虫 食源性疫情 公共卫生 进口生鲜 Cyclospora cayetanensis oocyst sporulation Guillain-Barré reactive arthritis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-twiv-一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻-洗不掉-养不活-验不出死活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻：洗不掉、养不活、验不出死活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">让美国上万人腹泻的卵囊对漂白剂和冲洗都有抵抗力，排出一到两周后才具感染性；实验室又养不活也验不出死活，疫情因此难以切断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寄生虫</span><span class=\"tag\">环孢子虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Mac 图标不是像素问题，是隐喻问题 少画几笔，用户才能把自己放进图标里。16×16 的黑白限制不是设计遗憾，而是逼出好想法的约束。 Y Combinator Y Combinator Susan Kare: Designing Icons &amp; Graphics For the Original Mac 图标设计 设计方法论 早期 Mac 品牌与 Logo Steve Jobs iconographer bitmap graphics proportionally spaced fonts cap height Letraset desktop metaphor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-ycsp-mac-图标不是像素问题-是隐喻问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba08e7524f0aad6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>Mac 图标不是像素问题，是隐喻问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少画几笔，用户才能把自己放进图标里。16×16 的黑白限制不是设计遗憾，而是逼出好想法的约束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">图标设计</span><span class=\"tag\">设计方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"时间不存在，宇宙并非从无中诞生 宇宙学家 Brian Keating 抛出一个反直觉判断：时间可能并不存在，宇宙并非从无产生；他还警告 AI 无法复现人类直觉，也无法被完全控制。 Into the Impossible With Brian Keating Into the Impossible With Brian Keating The Universe Didn’t Come From Nothing | The Peter McCormack Show 宇宙学 时间 AI 局限 引力波 科学信任 BICEP Array Simons Observatory Jevons Paradox UAP Cosmological Time Field\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-intotheimpossi-时间不存在-宇宙并非从无中诞生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a6e7a9d85c7b97f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>时间不存在，宇宙并非从无中诞生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宇宙学家 Brian Keating 抛出一个反直觉判断：时间可能并不存在，宇宙并非从无产生；他还警告 AI 无法复现人类直觉，也无法被完全控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙学</span><span class=\"tag\">时间</span>\n</div></div></a>"]